README
------

* Readfile.java
  demonstrates how to read the contents of a file, and prints it to 
  standard out line by line. Acts similar to the UNIX/Linux cat command.
  
* ReadfileNumberedLines.java
  demonstrates how to read the contents of a file, and prints it to 
  standard out line by line, with line numbers. Acts similar to the 
  UNIX/Linux commands cat combined with nl.

